WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:06.060
This is it, arcade engineer: your own game, built with everything you’ve learned.

2
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:15.720
Write a one-page game design: the goal, the player, what clones do, your variables, your states and how it ends.

3
00:00:15.720 --> 00:00:18.780
Clones for many enemies or items.

4
00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.680
Velocity for jumping.

5
00:00:20.680 --> 00:00:23.270
Lists for words or inventories.

6
00:00:23.270 --> 00:00:28.620
Get the smallest playable version working first (player + one rule).

7
00:00:28.620 --> 00:00:32.640
Then add one feature at a time and test after each.

8
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:38.550
Show your game, explain one clever piece of code, and share what playtesters said.

9
00:00:38.550 --> 00:00:41.900
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

10
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:45.550
Now plan it, build it, test it, and share it!
